From 580664f6804c516f2af6fbcbe6172e3a0060a724 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:33:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 53/57] Wild Pokemon levels 1.15x from the Erika stretch on

Matches the trainers' 1.15x scaling on Routes 7-21, Rock Tunnel, Pokemon
Tower, the Safari Zone, Power Plant, Seafoam, the Mansion and the Sevii
Islands 1-3 (Route 23, Victory Road and Cerulean Cave were already
scaled). Fishing levels are unchanged. tools/hack/wild_levels.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
---
 HACK_NOTES.md                 |    9 +-
 src/data/wild_encounters.json | 6093 +++++++++++++++++----------------
 tools/hack/wild_levels.py     |   36 +
 3 files changed, 3089 insertions(+), 3049 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/hack/wild_levels.py

diff --git a/HACK_NOTES.md b/HACK_NOTES.md
index 34c0b31..2bfdaab 100644
--- a/HACK_NOTES.md
+++ b/HACK_NOTES.md
@@ -401,9 +401,11 @@ How the cap works with each way of gaining levels:
 ### Trainers
 - Every Gym Leader has a new, larger team with max IVs, better moves and a held item.
 - Every other trainer's levels are scaled by 1.15x.
-- Wild Pokémon on Route 23, in Victory Road and in Cerulean Cave are also
-  1.15x higher (Victory Road now reaches Lv. 55), so there's somewhere worth
-  training before the Elite Four.
+- Wild Pokémon from the Erika stretch on are also 1.15x higher, so training
+  on them keeps pace with the trainers. This covers Routes 7–21, Rock Tunnel,
+  Pokémon Tower, the Safari Zone, Power Plant, Seafoam Islands, Pokémon
+  Mansion, the Sevii Islands 1–3, Route 23, Victory Road (now up to Lv. 55)
+  and Cerulean Cave. Fishing levels are unchanged.
 - **Gym double battles:** one trainer in each gym from Misty's on (except
   Cinnabar) fights two-on-two, with a team built for doubles:
   - Spread moves that hit both of your Pokémon, such as Twister, Electroweb,
@@ -519,6 +521,7 @@ Each script runs once against the original pret data:
 - `gym_doubles.py`: the gym double battles (one trainer per gym) and their doubles movesets.
 - `learnsets.py`: what each species can learn in this hack (used by the scripts that set trainer moves).
 - `vr_rematches.py`: the Victory Road VS Seeker rematch teams and scripts.
+- `wild_levels.py`: wild Pokémon levels 1.15x from the Erika stretch on.
 - `exp_budget.py`: how much trainer Exp. each stretch of the game gives, and
   where that leaves a team against each level cap.
 - `save_check.py REF`: checks whether saves from an older release (a git ref)
